{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/585402-exalted-edition-2-5-looking-for-players-age-of-discord","id":585402,"title":"Exalted Edition 2 (.5) Looking for Players -Age of Discord","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-09T17:28:04-07:00","id":585402,"title":"Exalted Edition 2 (.5) Looking for Players -Age of Discord","content":"I am an ST planning to start running an Exalted V2 Game. The expectation is primarily to be a Solar, but interesting characters of other concepts that work with the group may accepted.<br /> The plot is considered open world/sand-boxy. While a story and major events will be taking place, the player group can choose to be active in said world or separately work to create their own world altering events.<br /> <br /> The Current group has the basic interest in create a slave free state in the north and eventually challenging the Bull of the North (unless they come up with something better later).<br /> <br /> Game is expected to be a Skype text game on Saturdays start at 7pm Eastern time.<br /> Preference is to seek regular players. Occasional irregularity will not be penalized.<br /> If interested but may not be able to hold to a regular commitment, guest sports or wandering players may be allowed.<br /> <br /> Feel free to ask questions and PM for interest.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3862-forgotten-curse","name":"Forgotten.Curse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T13:49:19-07:00","id":595938,"title":"","content":"Are you still looking for players?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6293-whisper","name":"Whisper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6293_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T18:02:55-07:00","id":612869,"title":"","content":"Update, this game has not started yet and is still looking for players.<br /> The game will have a regulated Essence level that increases over time.<br /> PvP will be heavily limited. Actions will have consequences to the overall world.<br /> While preference is for solar characters, solar tiered characters will be allowed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3862-forgotten-curse","name":"Forgotten.Curse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-04T16:44:36-07:00","id":615728,"title":"","content":"other than the essence and pvp what house rules do you have and what homebrew do you use?<br /> <br /> I've got an idea for an Alchemical that might be fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T09:13:30-07:00","id":621382,"title":"","content":"Still clarifying some house rules with the group. Game has not quite started yet.<br /> Among other house rules, there will be a limted xp disparity (right now the highest disparity will be 20xp between the highest and lowest)<br /> Right now the player exalted consideration is limited to Solar Tier (Solars, Infernals, Abyssals). (This may be altered by players interest in concepts)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3862-forgotten-curse","name":"Forgotten.Curse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-06T11:11:26-07:00","id":654097,"title":"","content":"Is it too late to play a Solar?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7592-wtaylorjr2001","name":"wtaylorjr2001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-07T13:45:16-07:00","id":655480,"title":"","content":"Still looking to expand the player base.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3862-forgotten-curse","name":"Forgotten.Curse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T19:46:28-07:00","id":662581,"title":"","content":"I see that you're still looking for players, Let me ask. As a Avid 2.5 Player, what are the limitations of character creation? Standard 2.5 Rules using the Errata? Are Merits and Flaws allowed? Mutations as well? What splats are allowed?The Ink Monkeys? Dreams of the First Age, Lords of Creation? Rolls of Glorious Divinity, The Unconquered Sun? As well as the splats for Artifacts and armor, Wonders of the Lost Age and Oadenol's Codex. What are the limitations of what we can take? etc etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7803-williamkitt","name":"WilliamKitt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-12T23:54:04-07:00","id":662737,"title":"","content":"Color me interested, I've pm'd the OP some questions so feel free to answer them in the thread if relevant to other people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T07:57:44-07:00","id":663132,"title":"","content":"Thank you for your interest.<br /> The current setup is all of my players are looking to start in the Scavenger Lands. Two are from Lookshy, the 3rd is connected to a nearby Satrap nearby.<br /> Currently character creation is 2.5 rules using the errata, all books except for adventures, the shards book, and that one with 2 many 'x's in the title are not considered available.<br /> The Acceptable splats are Solar, Abyssal, Infernal. (Anything else needs special conditions.) There will be some checks on backgrounds but nothing much more than a simple explanation about acquisition. Merits/Flaws will need approval as with starting mutations. Beyond character creation there will be an additional starting xp of 100.<br /> <br /> The rest of the setting is taking some notes from asian warring states periods. The Blessed Isle is about to be at a civil war. During this war the threshold will be in its own conflict ridden period in which the various princedoms and city states will be able to pull away the Realm and some will grow into kingdoms and empires. Specific starting location right now is the Scavenger lands near Nexus. But Most of the creation will be available and anything I have suggested that will occur is still mutable.<br /> <br /> Game will be played on Skype Via text chat, some other side resources will be used in addition.<br /> If you have any additional questions or are interested, please let feel free to ask.<br /> I am sorry if I may have missed a question that was asked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3862-forgotten-curse","name":"Forgotten.Curse","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}